{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>שוא</b> — like falsehood." "<b>ודבר כזב</b> — that I not be a false witness. The vav of <b>ועושר</b> is in place of 'or.' [It] led me astray from <b>ויהי טרף בביתי</b>." "<b>חקי</b> — what is fitting for me to sustain upon it the soul."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:30.538979381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}